  <issue>
  Use STRING_AGG insted of GROUP_CONCAT in databricks
sqlglot==26.25.3

`
SELECT
  test,
  STRING_AGG(email, '') AS Email
FROM organizations
GROUP BY
test
`

The above query gets converted to
`
SELECT
  test,
  GROUP_CONCAT(email, '') AS Email
FROM organizations
GROUP BY
test
`

